gates.prompt:
Improve this conductor loop configuration based on the audit.

Original config:
{{loop_config}}

Audit findings:
{{loop-auditor.issues}}
Risk score: {{loop-auditor.risk_score}}

Fix all critical and high severity issues. Keep improvements minimal and backwards-compatible.

Return JSON:
{
  "improved_loop": { <complete improved loop JSON object> },
  "changes": ["what changed and why"]
}

Make the final decision on loop improvement for '{{blueprint_name}}'.

Original: {{loop_config}}
Risk score: {{loop-auditor.risk_score}}
Audit issues: {{loop-auditor.issues}}
Proposed changes: {{loop-improver.changes}}
Improved config: {{loop-improver.improved_loop}}

Rules:
- If risk_score == 0 and no critical/high issues: verdict = KEEP
- Otherwise: verdict = IMPROVED

Return JSON:
{
  "verdict": "IMPROVED" | "KEEP",
  "final_loop": { <loop config to use> },
  "diff_summary": "one sentence describing what changed"
}
